"added, it would also run the tests for recipes in the additional layers. "
"Different build targets can be defined using the "
":term:`OEQA_REPRODUCIBLE_TEST_TARGET` variable in :ref:`structure-build-"
"conf-local.conf`. For example, running reproducibility tests for only the"
" ``python3-numpy`` recipe can be done by setting::"
msgstr ""

