"The order you list tests in :term:`TEST_SUITES` is important and "
"influences test dependencies. Consequently, tests that depend on other "
"tests should be added after the test on which they depend. For example, "
"since the ``ssh`` test depends on the ``ping`` test, \"ssh\" needs to "
"come after \"ping\" in the list. The test class provides no re-ordering "
"or dependency handling."
