#: ../../test-manual/understand-autobuilder.rst:91
msgid ""
"This step clones the :yocto_git:`yocto-autobuilder-helper </yocto-"
"autobuilder-helper>` git repository. This is necessary to avoid the "
"requirement to maintain all the release or project-specific code within "
